            "content": "<p>Ask our team to confirm the wood treatment, finish and care requirements for your chosen item. We do not make a blanket pest-proof or mold-proof guarantee for every piece and environment. If you notice a problem after delivery, contact us with your order details and photos so we can review it.</p>",
