            "heading": "How long will it take to receive my order?",
            "content": "<p>Because our products are <strong>custom-made</strong>, delivery time includes both production and shipping.</p><ul><li><strong>Production time:</strong> approximately <strong>10–20 business days</strong><br/></li><li><strong>Shipping time to the U.S.:</strong> approximately <strong>10–25 business days</strong><br/></li></ul><p><strong>Estimated total delivery time:</strong> <strong>20–45 business days</strong> from the order date.</p><p>Once your order ships, you will receive a tracking number via email so you can follow its progress.</p><p>Please note that delivery times are estimates and may vary due to customs clearance, carrier delays, or peak seasons.</p>",
